opera-rs
Copyright (c) 2026 Qiusheng Wu

This software searches, visualizes, and analyzes NASA OPERA satellite products
(https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/go/opera) using NASA's public Common Metadata
Repository (CMR) and titiler-cmr (https://github.com/developmentseed/titiler-cmr).
It shares design patterns with opengeos/geolibre-nasa-opera, opengeos/lidar-rs,
and opengeos/terrio.

OPERA products are produced by NASA JPL's Observational Products for End-Users
from Remote Sensing Analysis (OPERA) project and distributed by NASA's PO.DAAC,
LP DAAC, and ASF DAAC.

Third-party crates used directly include:
- `clap` (https://github.com/clap-rs/clap): MIT OR Apache-2.0
- `gif` (https://github.com/image-rs/image-gif): MIT OR Apache-2.0
- `png` (https://github.com/image-rs/image-png): MIT OR Apache-2.0
- `rayon` (https://github.com/rayon-rs/rayon): MIT OR Apache-2.0
- `serde` / `serde_json` (https://github.com/serde-rs/serde): MIT OR Apache-2.0
- `thiserror` (https://github.com/dtolnay/thiserror): MIT OR Apache-2.0
- `ureq` (https://github.com/algesten/ureq): MIT OR Apache-2.0
